    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 064 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My Teacher Helps Me)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My teacher is helping me realize my dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My teacher also always tells us to set goals"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "in order to reach our dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He helps us. He tells us that we must read a lot of books."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He is very kind to each student and points out our good qualities."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He helps us to develop our talents."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My teacher always says that I should be a teacher"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "because of my good qualities."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "So now I want to become a teacher."
    },
